{
  "title": "World's Largest Deserts",
  "titleZh": "世界最大的沙漠",
  "source": "Encyclopaedia Britannica",
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.britannica.com/topic/worlds-largest-deserts-2225895",
  "lexile": 600,
  "grade": "小学五年级",
  "accent": "#c4782a",
  "story": {
    "title": "Deserts: Hot, Cold, and Huge",
    "titleZh": "沙漠：炎热、寒冷、巨大",
    "pages": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "imageKey": "cover",
        "focusWords": [
          "desert",
          "dry",
          "rain"
        ],
        "en": "What is a desert? A desert is a very dry place. It gets little rain. Some deserts are hot. Some deserts are cold.",
        "zh": "什么是沙漠？沙漠是非常干燥的地方。雨水很少。有些沙漠很热。有些沙漠很冷。"
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "imageKey": "rain",
        "focusWords": [
          "rain",
          "dry"
        ],
        "en": "How dry is a true desert? Many scientists say it gets 25 centimeters of rain or less in a year. That is less than the length of a school ruler!",
        "zh": "真正的沙漠有多干？许多科学家说，一年降雨不超过25厘米。那比一把尺子还短！"
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "imageKey": "polar",
        "focusWords": [
          "polar",
          "ice",
          "Antarctic"
        ],
        "en": "Surprise! The largest desert on Earth is not hot. It is the Antarctic Ice Sheet. It is made of ice. It gets almost no rain.",
        "zh": "惊喜！地球上最大的沙漠并不热。它是南极冰盖。它由冰组成。几乎不下雨。"
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "imageKey": "arctic",
        "focusWords": [
          "Arctic",
          "cold",
          "largest"
        ],
        "en": "The Arctic is the second largest desert. It is cold and icy too. Polar deserts sit near the North and South Poles.",
        "zh": "北极是第二大沙漠。它也很冷，还有冰。极地沙漠靠近南北两极。"
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "imageKey": "sahara",
        "focusWords": [
          "Sahara",
          "hot",
          "Africa"
        ],
        "en": "The Sahara is the largest hot desert. It covers a vast part of northern Africa. Days can be very hot. Nights can be cool.",
        "zh": "撒哈拉是最大的热沙漠。它覆盖非洲北部的广阔地区。白天可能很热。夜晚可能凉爽。"
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "imageKey": "arabian",
        "focusWords": [
          "Arabian",
          "Asia",
          "sand"
        ],
        "en": "The Arabian Desert is in southwestern Asia. It has sand dunes and harsh, dry land. It is one of the biggest deserts on Earth.",
        "zh": "阿拉伯沙漠在亚洲西南部。那里有沙丘和严酷干燥的土地。它是地球上最大的沙漠之一。"
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "imageKey": "gobi",
        "focusWords": [
          "Gobi",
          "cold",
          "mountain"
        ],
        "en": "The Gobi Desert is in Mongolia and China. It is a cold winter desert. Tall mountains help block rain. That makes a rain shadow.",
        "zh": "戈壁沙漠在蒙古和中国。它是冬天寒冷的沙漠。高山挡住雨水。这样就形成了雨影。"
      },
      {
        "id": "p8",
        "imageKey": "worldmap",
        "focusWords": [
          "continent",
          "Earth",
          "vast"
        ],
        "en": "More huge deserts wait around the world. The Kalahari is in Africa. Patagonia is in Argentina. The Great Victoria is in Australia. The Great Basin is in the United States.",
        "zh": "世界各地还有更多大沙漠。卡拉哈里在非洲。巴塔哥尼亚在阿根廷。维多利亚大沙漠在澳大利亚。大盆地在美国。"
      },
      {
        "id": "p9",
        "imageKey": "cover",
        "focusWords": [
          "desert",
          "Earth",
          "largest"
        ],
        "en": "Deserts are the second biggest land biome after forests. They are vast, dry, and often harsh. Next time you hear desert, think hot sand—and cold ice too!",
        "zh": "沙漠是仅次于森林的第二大陆地生物群落。它们广阔、干燥，常常严酷。下次听到沙漠，想想热沙子——还有冷冰！"
      }
    ]
  },
